    "title": "Muscatine Radio Station Becomes Home For All Iowa Hawkeye Sports - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Connor Kenney ,\n13 hours ago Hawkeye fans in Muscatine and the surrounding area have a new home for every Iowa game. All Iowa Hawkeye sports can now be heard on MC 93, 93.1 FM. You no longer need to switch between stations to catch football or basketball. Find Iowa Football, Men’s Basketball, and Women’s Basketball all in one place this season and beyond. Read full article",
